  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Boil the kettle. Half-fill a medium saucepan with boiling water.\n• Cook egg noodles over medium-high heat, stirring occasionally with a fork to separate, until tender, 4-5 mins.\n• Drain, rinse and set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a5459b36e4158183d5e3c10/step-c1472800.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, finely chop or crush garlic. Thinly slice carrot into half-moons. Cut Malaysian tofu into bite-sized chunks.\n• Heat a large frying pan over medium-high heat with a generous drizzle of olive oil.\n• When oil is hot, cook tofu, tossing occasionally, until golden brown, 2-4 mins. Transfer to a plate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a5459b36e4158183d5e3c10/step-a9f1c610.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Return frying pan to high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook carrot, tossing, until softened, 4-5 mins.\n• Add Southeast Asian spice blend, garlic and ginger paste and cook until fragrant, 1 min.\n• Stir in coconut milk, the soy sauce, stock powder and water, cook until slightly reduced, 1-2 mins.\n• Remove pan from heat and add cooked egg noodles, tofu and baby spinach leaves, tossing to coat. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a5459b36e4158183d5e3c10/step-5055dd20.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Divide Malaysian-spiced tofu curry between bowls to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a5459b36e4158183d5e3c10/step-06422830.jpeg"
    }
  ]
